# fp2: Agon 02_sand_sandfalls layer 8, for tools/cov/specs/flyingpirate_fp2.py (forced arms).
# The ordinary fight of flyingpirate_sandfalls.con, plus HearPlayer asked while the player
# walks, Taunt / Dodge / Lurk entered on u06de, and u06cf put next to the player to shoot.
@f300 layer 8
@f560 god 1; give missile 50; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; give annihilatorBeam 1
@f600 tp -95 -100 -8
@f610 face 180
@f700 stick 0 127 60
@f710 trigcall u06de HearPlayer; trigcall u06cf HearPlayer
@f720 trigcall u06de HearPlayer; trigcall u06cf HearPlayer
@f730 trigcall u06de HearPlayer; trigcall u06cf HearPlayer
@f740 trigcall u06de HearPlayer; trigcall u06cf HearPlayer
@f760 noise 0; noise 1; noise 2; noise 3; noise 4; noise 5
@f800 fsm u06de Taunt
@f900 fsm u06de Lurk
@f1000 fsm u06de Dodge
@f1100 fsm u06de Taunt
@f1150 fsm u06de Attack
@f1200 shoot u06de
@f1230 shoot u06de
@f1260 shoot u06de missile
@f1300 place u06cf player 4
@f1340 place u06cf player 4
@f1380 place u06cf player 3
@f1400 noise 0; noise 1; noise 2
@f1500 shoot u06cf charged
@f1600 damage u06cf 5 10
@f1650 fsm u06de Lurk
@f1800 fsm u06de Dodge
@f1900 fsm u06de Attack
@f2000 damage u06de 10 0 missile
@f2100 stick 0 127 40
@f2110 trigcall u06de HearPlayer; trigcall u06cf HearPlayer
@f2120 trigcall u06de HearPlayer; trigcall u06cf HearPlayer
@f2200 fsm u06de Taunt
@f2300 fsm u06de Lurk
@f2400 damage u06cf 1000
@f2700 obj u06cf
@f3000 damage u06de 1000 0 dark
@f3300 obj u06de
@f3500 status
